#: d1c7caa567894de38427b6c1dcbb8647
msgid ""
"the heading entered should be TRUE, not MAGNETIC. Using a phone's compass "
"app will usually required adding the local declination value to the reading "
"in order to obtain the TRUE geographic heading which should be entered."
msgstr "输入的航向应为真北，而非磁北。使用手机的罗盘应用通常需要在读数上加上当地磁偏角值，才能获得应输入的真实地理航向。"

